{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/instrucciones/layout,_N_T_/instrucciones/estudiante/layout,_N_T_/instrucciones/estudiante/page,_N_T_/instrucciones/estudiante"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--ZeTrfArmvTDf2IAQjbh65--><html lang=\"es\" class=\"__className_ac79ff\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/ec1a1eae803b668e-s.p.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"https://loopaas.app/loopaas_logo_square.png\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/26fe48b0d9cc85b1.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/9495965af8e601e0.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-03d39388decbaeac.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-cc729d47eba2cee4.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5964-72d6ccd9257dfb14.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-1897572879d78c32.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/44530001-ad86ecd83cf8b35b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4277-eb45f09a29f49c87.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/6874-61b4c5756db3a422.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1840-513dcae355ffa03f.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/8740-ca2ad053ae8552bd.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4765-c6b581bc363c8e08.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/6747-9c8db04055c34d0e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/5293-2ccc131d3e91269b.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/9292-dcf8ff1faf119072.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/570-1cb4954a131157ac.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4392-9c43bf75a72401ff.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-aaf5b4ad6f8aa300.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4700-d916a28acec619d9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/error-af735a57ecd6c5c2.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/not-found-f207bec3b8c949ca.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/instrucciones/estudiante/page-f989552d7a8b6e9d.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.json\"/><meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#146233\"/><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\"/><meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"default\"/><link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/loopaas_logo_square.png\"/><title>Loopaas</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Loopaas es una aplicación web para gestionar cursos, credenciales y evaluaciones para equipos y organizaciones\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"loopaas,cursos,credenciales,evaluaciones,educación,gestión académica\"/><meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"43TwFvQymK3-1sNg02-KVCL_ryqBTvr9zpJBQX1aVms\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Loopaas\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Aplicación web para gestionar cursos, credenciales y evaluaciones\"/><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://loopaas.app\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Loopaas\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"es_CL\"/><meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"600\"/><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://loopaas.app/opengraph-image.png?2e0bc232e210f89d\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Loopaas\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Aplicación web para gestionar cursos, credenciales y evaluaciones\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:type\" content=\"image/png\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:width\" content=\"1200\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image:height\" content=\"600\"/><meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://loopaas.app/twitter-image.png?2e0bc232e210f89d\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/x-icon\" sizes=\"219x219\"/><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"SoftwareApplication\",\"name\":\"Loopaas\",\"url\":\"https://loopaas.app\",\"applicationCategory\":\"EducationalApplication\",\"operatingSystem\":\"Web\",\"description\":\"Aplicación para la gestión de cursos, credenciales y evaluaciones\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Emmanuel Norambuena\",\"url\":\"https://eanorambuena.github.io\"},\"offers\":{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"price\":\"0\",\"priceCurrency\":\"USD\"}}</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"bg-background overflow-x-hidden text-foreground\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full overflow-hidden\" style=\"opacity:0\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-screen h-screen z-40 pointer-events-none\"><div style=\"transform:translateY(-350px) rotate(-45deg);background:radial-gradient(68.54% 68.72% at 55.02% 31.46%, hsla(210, 100%, 85%, .08) 0, hsla(210, 100%, 55%, .02) 50%, hsla(210, 100%, 45%, 0) 80%);width:560px;height:1380px\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0\"></div><div style=\"transform:rotate(-45deg) translate(5%, -50%);background:radial-gradient(50% 50% at 50% 50%, hsla(210, 100%, 85%, .06) 0, hsla(210, 100%, 55%, .02) 80%, transparent 100%);width:240px;height:1380px\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 origin-top-left\"></div><div style=\"transform:rotate(-45deg) translate(-180%, -70%);background:radial-gradient(50% 50% at 50% 50%, hsla(210, 100%, 85%, .04) 0, hsla(210, 100%, 45%, .02) 80%, transparent 100%);width:240px;height:1380px\" class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 origin-top-left\"></div></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-screen h-screen z-40 pointer-events-none\"><div style=\"transform:translateY(-350px) rotate(45deg);background:radial-gradient(68.54% 68.72% at 55.02% 31.46%, hsla(210, 100%, 85%, .08) 0, hsla(210, 100%, 55%, .02) 50%, hsla(210, 100%, 45%, 0) 80%);width:560px;height:1380px\" class=\"absolute top-0 right-0\"></div><div style=\"transform:rotate(45deg) translate(-5%, -50%);background:radial-gradient(50% 50% at 50% 50%, hsla(210, 100%, 85%, .06) 0, hsla(210, 100%, 55%, .02) 80%, transparent 100%);width:240px;height:1380px\" class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 origin-top-right\"></div><div style=\"transform:rotate(45deg) translate(180%, -70%);background:radial-gradient(50% 50% at 50% 50%, hsla(210, 100%, 85%, .04) 0, hsla(210, 100%, 45%, .02) 80%, transparent 100%);width:240px;height:1380px\" class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 origin-top-right\"></div></div></div><main class=\"min-h-screen relative w-full flex flex-col items-center\"><div class=\"inset-x-0 w-full fixed top-4 left-0 right-0 z-50\"><div class=\"relative z-[60] mx-auto hidden w-full max-w-7xl flex-row items-center justify-between self-start rounded-full bg-transparent px-4 py-2 lg:flex dark:bg-transparent\" style=\"min-width:800px\"><a class=\"relative z-20 mr-4 flex items-center space-x-2 px-2 py-1 text-sm font-normal text-black\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://loopaas.app/loopaas_logo_square.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/><span class=\"font-medium text-black dark:text-white\">Loopaas</span></a><div class=\"absolute inset-0 hidden flex-1 flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-2 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-600 transition duration-200 hover:text-zinc-800 lg:flex lg:space-x-2\"></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><a class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-md button text-black text-sm font-bold relative cursor-pointer hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition duration-200 inline-block text-center bg-transparent shadow-none dark:text-white\" href=\"/login\">Iniciar sesión</a></div></div><div class=\"relative z-50 mx-auto flex w-full max-w-[calc(100vw-2rem)] flex-col items-center justify-between bg-transparent px-0 py-2 lg:hidden\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between\"><a class=\"relative z-20 mr-4 flex items-center space-x-2 px-2 py-1 text-sm font-normal text-black\" href=\"/\"><img src=\"https://loopaas.app/loopaas_logo_square.png\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/><span class=\"font-medium text-black dark:text-white\">Loopaas</span></a><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"tabler-icon tabler-icon-menu-2 text-black dark:text-white\"><path d=\"M4 6l16 0\"></path><path d=\"M4 12l16 0\"></path><path d=\"M4 18l16 0\"></path></svg></div></div></div><section class=\"flex-1 mt-20 w-full flex flex-col gap-5 items-center\"><section class=\"w-full mx-4 px-3 sm:px-4 flex flex-row justify-start items-center max-w-4xl mt-8\"><a class=\"flex items-center py-2 px-4 rounded-md no-underline text-foreground bg-btn-background hover:bg-btn-background-hover group text-sm w-fit\"><svg class=\"mr-2 h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-1\" fill=\"none\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\"><polyline points=\"15 18 9 12 15 6\"></polyline></svg> <!-- -->Volver atrás</a></section><div><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-emerald-100 dark:from-gray-900 dark:to-gray-800\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 py-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4\">Guía para Estudiantes - <!-- -->Loopaas</h1><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">Aprende cómo participar en evaluaciones y coevaluaciones de manera efectiva</p></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info h-6 w-6 text-green-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg>¿Qué es <!-- -->Loopaas<!-- --> para estudiantes?</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Loopaas<!-- --> es una plataforma que te permite participar en evaluaciones y coevaluaciones de tus cursos universitarios. Como estudiante, puedes responder evaluaciones creadas por tus profesores y contribuir a la evaluación de tus compañeros de manera justa y constructiva.</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-6\"><div class=\"text-center p-4 bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-950/20 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-text h-8 w-8 text-green-600 mx-auto mb-2\"><path d=\"M15 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7Z\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 9H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 13H8\"></path><path d=\"M16 17H8\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Responder Evaluaciones</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Participa en evaluaciones de tus cursos</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/20 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-8 w-8 text-blue-600 mx-auto mb-2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Coevaluación</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Evalúa a tus compañeros de manera justa</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4 bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-950/20 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bar-chart3 h-8 w-8 text-purple-600 mx-auto mb-2\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Ver Resultados</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Accede a estadísticas cuando estén disponibles</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-6 w-6 text-blue-600\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>Cómo Participar en Evaluaciones</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-6\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4\">Acceso a Evaluaciones</h3><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-0.5\">1</div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Recibir Enlace</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Tu profesor te enviará un enlace directo a la evaluación o podrás acceder desde el dashboard de tu curso.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-0.5\">2</div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Leer Instrucciones</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Lee cuidadosamente las instrucciones y el contexto de la evaluación antes de comenzar.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold mt-0.5\">3</div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">Responder Preguntas</h4><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Completa todas las preguntas requeridas de manera honesta y constructiva.</p></div></div></div></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4\">Tipos de Preguntas</h3><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">Texto Libre</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Escribe tus respuestas en tus propias palabras</p></div><div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">Opción Múltiple</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Selecciona la opción que mejor represente tu opinión</p></div><div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-sm\">Escala Likert</h4><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Evalúa diferentes criterios en una escala (ej: 1-5)</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg>Coevaluación: Evaluando a tus Compañeros</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-6\"><div class=\"bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/20 p-4 rounded-lg\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300 mb-2\">¿Qué es la Coevaluación?</h3><p class=\"text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-200 text-sm\">La coevaluación es un proceso donde evalúas el trabajo y contribución de tus compañeros de equipo o grupo. Es una herramienta valiosa para el aprendizaje colaborativo.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4\">Principios de una Buena Coevaluación</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Sé objetivo y justo en tus evaluaciones</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Evalúa basándote en criterios específicos, no en preferencias personales</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Proporciona comentarios constructivos cuando sea posible</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Considera el esfuerzo y la contribución real al proyecto</span></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4\">Qué Evitar</h3><ul class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-4 w-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">No evalúes basándote en amistad o enemistad personal</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-4 w-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Evita dar puntuaciones extremas sin justificación</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-4 w-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">No copies las evaluaciones de otros compañeros</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert h-4 w-4 text-red-500 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">No dejes evaluaciones incompletas o apresuradas</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-help h-6 w-6 text-orange-600\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg>Consejos Prácticos</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-6\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4\">Antes de Evaluar</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Lee cuidadosamente las instrucciones de la evaluación</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Asegúrate de tener suficiente tiempo para completar la evaluación</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Ten presente los criterios de evaluación</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-blue-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Reflexiona sobre la contribución real de cada compañero</span></li></ul></div><div><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold mb-4\">Durante la Evaluación</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-green-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Tómate tu tiempo para pensar en cada respuesta</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-green-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Sé consistente en tus evaluaciones</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-green-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Proporciona comentarios específicos cuando sea posible</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4 text-green-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm\">Revisa tus respuestas antes de enviar</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bar-chart3 h-6 w-6 text-indigo-600\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg>Resultados y Estadísticas</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0 space-y-4\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300\">Una vez que las evaluaciones estén cerradas, tu profesor puede compartir contigo las estadísticas y resultados. Estos te ayudarán a entender:</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-4\"><div class=\"text-center p-4 bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/20 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bar-chart3 h-8 w-8 text-indigo-600 mx-auto mb-2\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Tus Resultados</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Cómo te evaluaron tus compañeros</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4 bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-950/20 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-8 w-8 text-purple-600 mx-auto mb-2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Comparación Grupal</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Cómo se comparan los resultados del grupo</p></div><div class=\"text-center p-4 bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-950/20 rounded-lg\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-8 w-8 text-green-600 mx-auto mb-2\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Áreas de Mejora</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400\">Identificar oportunidades de crecimiento</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm mb-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold tracking-tight flex items-center gap-2 text-2xl\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-6 w-6 text-blue-600\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg>¿Necesitas Ayuda?</h3></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4\">Si tienes preguntas sobre cómo usar <!-- -->Loopaas<!-- --> o necesitas ayuda con una evaluación, no dudes en contactar a tu profesor o al equipo de soporte.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-10 px-4 py-2\" href=\"/instrucciones\">Ver Instrucciones Generales</a><a href=\"mailto:soporte.idsapp@gmail.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground h-10 px-4 py-2\">Contactar Soporte</a></div></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"pointer-events:none\"><ol tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"fixed top-[80%] z-[100] left-0 md:left-[40%] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></ol></div><footer class=\"w-full border-t border-t-foreground/10 p-8 flex flex-col gap-4 justify-center text-center text-xs\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 hover:text-accent-fo